vetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI发布GPT-Live-Transcribe与GPT-Transcribe两款转录模型</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI与Anthropic等千名AI员工联名上书呼吁政府管控自动化AI开发</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic模型Claude Mythos成功破译HAWK后量子算法及AES-128加密</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌AI概览覆盖率升至43%：搜索模式从网页导航转向直接交付答案</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/528f30f7a6d293c1beb9fc0a23e40c30.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Similarweb最新报告显示，谷歌AI概览在搜索结果中的出现比例已从一年前的15%跃升至43%，AI模式访问量从2025年6月的1.26亿次增长至2026年5月的2.79亿次。用户搜索习惯正从关键词查询转向长对话式查询，搜索体验已从“帮用户找网页”演变为“直接给答案”。此变革深刻影响流量分配，尽管AI引用数量增长超5倍，但流量转化存在不确定性。以ChatGPT为例，其5月7日搜索更新后，网页推荐流量占比从25%提升至近60%，显示AI产品在引用与导流机制上的优化可改善内容生态。谷歌已从传统导航工具转型为信息消费平台，搜索结果页成为信息交付终点。对内容生产者而言，传统依赖搜索导流的模式正被瓦解，优化内容结构以提升AI可见性成为获取新流量的关键。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">摩尔线程MTT S5000完成适配，成功拉起2.8万亿参数Kimi K3模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/66eb33fc0b7a17b95d2eb21bbdc1c39a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">摩尔线程宣布，其自研的AI训推一体智算卡MTT S5000已成功适配并稳定拉起月之暗面最新开源的2.8万亿参数Kimi K3模型。此次适配依托于摩尔线程自研的MUSA软件栈，该软件栈作为底层生态底座，实现了芯片算力与开发者调用接口的有效转化。MTT S5000作为摩尔线程的核心算力产品，在本次测试中展现了对超大规模开源模型的支撑能力。随着Kimi K3模型权重与技术报告的公开，摩尔线程通过MUSA架构完成了从底层硬件到上层模型的全链路打通。这一进展标志着国产GPU在处理万亿级参数大模型方面取得关键突破，进一步拓宽了国产算力在复杂AI任务中的应用边界，为行业开发者提供了更多元化的算力基础设施选择。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI发布GPT-Live-Transcribe与GPT-Transcribe两款转录模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/582a5a22738f6362a99e79de2688fac9.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI于7月29日正式通过API上线GPT-Live-Transcribe与GPT-Transcribe两款转录模型。GPT-Live-Transcribe主打低延迟实时转录，定价为每分钟0.017美元；GPT-Transcribe则针对批量异步任务优化，定价为每分钟0.0045美元。新模型核心优势在于上下文感知能力，在Context Aware ASR基准测试中，GPT-Transcribe接入上下文后语义准确率提升至45.2%。性能方面，新模型大幅超越Whisper（whisper-1），在Common Voice覆盖的22种语言中，GPT-Transcribe将转录错误率降至19.27%，远低于Whisper的40.37%；在真实世界录音基准上，其错误率仅为8.98%，显著优于Whisper的15.</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI与Anthropic等千名AI员工联名上书呼吁政府管控自动化AI开发</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d01e484e57136c613ef0137fafac685d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">来自OpenAI、Anthropic、谷歌和Meta等头部公司的1100多名员工联合签署公开信，呼吁美国政府介入并把控AI发展节奏。此次倡议核心聚焦于“自动化AI开发”，即AI系统具备递归式自我改进能力，可能导致技术演进速度超出人类控制范畴。Anthropic指出其Claude系列模型正快速接近该门槛。签署名单包括Anthropic CEO达里奥·阿莫代伊、OpenAI首席科学家雅库布·帕霍茨基及Meta首席科学家赵晟佳等行业核心人物。OpenAI CEO萨姆·奥尔特曼态度发生显著转变，从2023年拒绝签署类似放缓倡议转为公开支持，认为需建立防护机制以适应新能力水平。行业呼吁政府支持国际合作，开发必要的技术与治理工具，以应对AI军备竞赛中安全保障与治理体系滞后的风险，确保社会有足够时间应对前沿模型带来的潜在挑战</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic模型Claude Mythos成功破译HAWK后量子算法及AES-128加密</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b91fd4d2b93caa6f33d3d52b21ad89e7.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic旗下AI模型Claude Mythos Preview近日展现出在密码学领域的自主推理与攻击能力，成功发现并破译两项关键加密算法。在针对NIST后量子签名方案候选算法HAWK的测试中，Mythos通过多智能体半自主系统，利用数学格对称性，仅耗时60小时及10万美元API成本便攻破了该方案。此外，针对简化版AES-128加密标准，Mythos在消耗10亿代币后自主研发出“莫比乌斯桥”指纹识别攻击法，将攻击效率提升200至800倍。Anthropic表示上述研究不影响当前实际系统，且已完成漏洞协调披露。为应对AI带来的安全挑战，公司联合苏黎世联邦理工学院等机构推出了CryptanalysisBench基准测试。该进展标志着大模型在复杂数学与密码学分析领域已具备突破性能力，对现有互联网安全假设构成潜</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
